      "generator": "Codex 内置 ImageGen",
      "prompt": "Use case: scientific-educational.\nAsset type: one transparent PNG sprite atlas with nine independent illustrations for a first-grade Mandarin shadow classroom. True transparent alpha background. Exactly 3 columns × 3 rows of equal square cells, with boundaries at thirds of width and height. One isolated illustration centered in each cell, occupy 62% of that cell, preserve empty alpha margins around every object; each will be cropped separately. No outlines, gridlines, backgrounds, cast shadows, labels, text, numbers or watermarks. All subjects use identical fine paper texture, matte gouache cut-paper contours, deep pine green, warm cream, apricot and persimmon orange. Strong color contrast and shape clarity when each icon is rendered at 32 pixels.\nRow 1 left: small friendly mint-green toy delivery cart in near side view, with two dark wheels, warm cream open cargo bed and single orange nose. Row 1 center: identical toy delivery cart viewed the same way, now carrying one neutral tan cube; preserve exact silhouette and palette. Row 1 right: one compact orange patrol toy truck in side view with a cream stripe, obviously distinct from mint delivery cart.\nRow 2 left: one sturdy apricot-colored flashlight with deep pine-green ring at the head, viewed from above, aimed upwards in the square, with no light beam. Row 2 center: one simple clearly recognizable fresh green maple leaf with pointed edges and small stem. Row 2 right: one brass handbell with warm orange wooden handle.\nRow 3 left: one muted persimmon rectangular paper bookmark with a single cream tassel, whole object. Row 3 center: one green paper person puppet with a cream head and two limbs per side, from directly overhead and pointed toward the TOP of the cell, a small nose pointing UP shows the face direction, its face and two tiny eyes oriented up; body perfectly upright, a simple classroom tabletop paper figurine suitable for composition into precise diagrams. Row 3 right: one miniature image of an adult hand doing a rabbit hand shadow gesture in front of a small cream rectangular tabletop shadow screen; show the dark unmistakable two-eared rabbit silhouette on the cream screen and the hand outside the screen at lower left. Keep this small illustration coherent and self-contained on true alpha.\nUse no extra decorations or particle effects. Keep the outline easy to crop."
    },
